# Curse of Vitality, T:Mode$ AttackersDeclared | AttackedTarget$ Player.EnchantedBy.
# The AI controls the curse on itself: it gains 2, then Defined$
# TriggeredAttackingPlayer.Opponent+controlsCreature.attacking Player.EnchantedBy
# names the human (an opponent of the curse controller, with a creature attacking
# the enchanted player), who gains 2 too (AbilityUtils.java:1186-1196).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
resolvestack
